| EDA Technique       | Purpose                               | Example                              |
| ------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |
| Time Series Plot    | Identify trend and pattern            | Stock prices increasing over time    |
| Summary Statistics  | Check mean, min, max, std             | Average sales = 500                  |
| Missing Value Check | Find gaps in dates                    | Missing stock market days            |
| Trend Analysis      | Detect upward/downward movement       | Sales increasing yearly              |
| Seasonal Analysis   | Find repeating patterns               | Ice cream sales rise every summer    |
| Stationarity Test   | Check if mean & variance are constant | Required for ARIMA                   |
| ACF Plot            | Check autocorrelation                 | Current value depends on past values |
| PACF Plot           | Find direct lag relationships         | Helps find AR order                  |
| Lag Plot            | Visual autocorrelation                | Pattern vs random                    |
| Decomposition       | Separate trend, seasonality, residual | Understand components                |
| Entropy Analysis    | Measure randomness                    | Predictable or not                   |
| Outlier Detection   | Find abnormal points                  | Sudden stock crash                   |

