Entire Workflow

| Step | Activity               | Why?                  |
| ---- | ---------------------- | --------------------- |
| 1    | Load Dataset           | Read stock data       |
| 2    | Plot Series            | Find trend            |
| 3    | Seasonal Decomposition | Find seasonality      |
| 4    | ADF Test               | Check stationarity    |
| 5    | ACF                    | Find MA(q)            |
| 6    | PACF                   | Find AR(p)            |
| 7    | Lag Plot               | Check autocorrelation |
| 8    | Approximate Entropy    | Measure randomness    |
| 9    | Sample Entropy         | Measure complexity    |
| 10   | Forecasting Model      | ARIMA/SARIMA/LSTM     |

